# decoys_demo.smi — DEMONSTRATION decoy pool for the enrichment benchmark (SPEC #5).
# ⚠ NOT a DUD-E property-matched set. These are mechanism-distinct APPROVED ANTIVIRALS
# (HIV/HCV protease, NS5A, neuraminidase, cap-endonuclease inhibitors) that do NOT bind
# the RdRp NTP site — a reasonable "presumed-inactive" decoy set for THIS pocket, with
# real/correct SMILES (committed in ligands_chembl.json). For a rigorous benchmark,
# replace via fetch_decoys' DUD-E / LUDe / property-matched-ZINC path. Format:
# `SMILES  name  CHEMBL_id`.
